# Build artifacts produced by video-driver/Makefile:
#  - driver/driver is a leftover self-referential symlink from a failed
#    build run (the recipe meant to create msm_video/driver → driver
#    but can end up at driver/driver under some conditions).
#  - video_generated_h is regenerated each build with date/host strings.
driver/driver
msm_video/driver
video/driver
driver/vidc/inc/video_generated_h
